<view class="page"><view class="title">今天，想记住什么？</view><view class="sub">小小的一件事，也值得留在书里。</view><view class="label">宝宝照片<text class="optional">1–6 张，推荐 2–4 张</text></view><view class="small">选几张照片，让叽咕认识今天的主角。</view><view class="photos"><view wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="path" class="photo"><image src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFill"/><button class="delete" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="remove" disabled="{{busy}}" aria-label="删除第{{index+1}}张照片">×</button></view><button wx:if="{{photos.length &lt; 6}}" class="upload" bindtap="pick" disabled="{{busy}}">＋<view>选照片</view></button></view><view class="tiny">尽量看清脸，上传后会去掉照片里的位置信息。</view><view class="label">今天发生了什么？</view><textarea data-field="event" value="{{event}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="1600" disabled="{{busy || bookId}}" placeholder="例如：今天宝宝发烧了，不能出门，在家披着我的围巾玩国王游戏。"/><view class="label">当时是什么心情？<text class="optional">选填</text></view><textarea class="short" data-field="mood" value="{{mood}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="500" disabled="{{busy || bookId}}" placeholder="例如：我觉得她特别可爱。"/><view class="label">想记住的小细节<text class="optional">选填</text></view><textarea data-field="detail" value="{{detail}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="500" disabled="{{busy || bookId}}" placeholder="例如：宝宝披着紫色围巾说，我是国王先生！"/><view class="label">宝宝怎么称呼？<text class="optional">选填</text></view><input data-field="nickname" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="40" disabled="{{busy || bookId}}" placeholder="例如：开心、乐乐、小宝"/><view class="label">故事日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="date" disabled="{{busy || bookId}}"><view class="date">{{date}}　›</view></picker><checkbox-group bindchange="consent"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{consent}}" color="#ad6b4d"/><text>我有权使用这些照片，同意用于制作本次小书</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="text-button" bindtap="privacy">照片使用与隐私说明</button><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">{{busy ? '正在收好照片和故事…' : '整理成小故事'}}</button><view class="tiny center">这一步只整理文字，确认后才开始画画。</view></view><canvas type="2d" id="photoCanvas" class="canvas-hidden"/>